msgid "The default domain is set with ``primary_domain`` in ``conf.toml`` (default: ``\"py\"``). When a primary domain is active, its directives and roles can be written without the domain prefix (for example, ``.. function::`` instead of ``.. py:function::``, and ``:func:`name``` instead of ``:py:func:`name```)."
