msgid "**Current scope resolution**: Relative references look up names within the active module or namespace before falling back to global lookup."
msgstr ""

#: ../../topics/domains.rst:226
msgid "**Exact match**: Prefixing with a dot (``.``) searches from the current module or enclosing object."
msgstr ""

